WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.303
&gt;&gt; SOME OF THE WORST OF THE
FIGHTING IS IN EASTERN UKRAINE,

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:06.106
FOR RUSSIAN FORCES HAVE
UNLEASHED AND RELENTLESS

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.574
BARRAGE OF ARTILLERY FOR
MONTHS.

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:10.043
THIS PART OF MOSCOW'S PUSH TO
CAPTURE THE ENTIRE DONBAS

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.011
REGION.
DESPITE THE CONSTANT FIGHTING

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:14.147
THE, FRONT LINES OF BRIGHT MOOD
FOR WEEKS.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.316
THE RESIDENTS LIVING NEARBY,
THE THREAT OF DEATH IS NEVER

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.518
FAR AWAY.
CNN'S NICK ROBERTSON HAS MORE.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:26.159
INSTEAD ASK, CIVILIANS ARE
BURIED WHERE THEY FALL, NO TIME,

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:30.130
NO SAFETY FOR A CEMETERY
SENDOFF.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:34.134
NO BOMB TOO BIG, THEY ARE
BUILDING IN THIS EASTERN

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:39.172
UKRAINIAN TOWN SEEMINGLY OFF
RUSSIA'S TARGET LIST IN THEIR

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:41.741
SLOW BUT RELENTLESS PUSH
WESTWARDS.

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:45.845
&gt;&gt; THIS TOWN IS UNDER THE
FRINGES FOR THE UKRAINIAN

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:48.114
GOVERNMENT CONTROLS.
THEY ARE SURROUNDED ON TWO

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:53.820
SIDES BY RUSSIAN FORCES TO THE
EAST AND TO THE NORTH, ABOUT

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.855
500 --
FIVE MILES OR TEN KILOMETERS

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:58.258
AWAY.
SHELLING HERE, AND EVER-PRESENT

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:01.294
DANGER.
AMONG THE RUINS, PEOPLE ARE

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:07.200
SURVIVING.
2000 OF A PREWAR, 11 DOZEN

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:11.304
CLINGING ON.
FOR THE AREA, BARELY SEEMS TO

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.405
NOTICE SOME OF THE SHELL
EXPLODING.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:15.241
HOW HARD IS IT TO LIVE HERE NOW?
&gt;&gt; [INTERPRETER]

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:22.148
I DON'T REALIZE IT, BUT SHE'S
ABOUT TO TEACH ME HOW HARD --

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:24.851
&gt;&gt; SHE'S NOT GETTING, SHE COMES
BACK WITH THIS OR ANY FLOOR

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:27.587
BORIS CABBAGE FROM A BURNT
BUILDING.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:32.125
EVERY DAY.
&gt;&gt; EVERY DAY, SO THIS IS HARD.

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:35.061
GOOD MUSCLES, WHY DO YOU STAY
HERE?

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:39.832
IF IT IS SO HARD, BODIES DAY?
&gt;&gt; VALERIA'S LESSON FOR ME, YES,

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:44.404
LIFE HERE IS VERY HARD, BUT
THIS IS HOME AND LEAVING WOULD

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:49.209
BE HARDER.
&gt;&gt; MY HOUSE, WHILE.

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:56.082
&gt;&gt; BUT YOU DO SO TO USE?
THERE ARE BOMBS AND EXPLOSIONS.

00:01:56.082 --> 00:02:03.089
&gt;&gt; SO NICE THIS DAY, SHE SAYS.
WE GO IN THE BASEMENT WHEN

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:06.492
THERE IS SHELLING.
&gt;&gt; SHE LEAVES TO SEE THE

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:09.295
BASEMENT.
&gt;&gt; SO YOU ARE SLEEPING IN HERE,

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:11.297
YOU'RE LIVING ON HERE?
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE BEEN SLIPPING DOWN

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.133
HERE FOR MORE THAN THREE MONTHS,
SHE SAYS.

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:19.639
DOWN HERE, HER CHEERFUL SPARKLE
IS GONE.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:23.443
WE HAD NO GAS, ELECTRICITY,
WATER OR COMMUNICATIONS, SHE

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:25.178
SAYS.
I HAVE NOWHERE TO GO.

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:28.114
THERE IS MORE SHE WANTS TO SHOW
US.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:37.290
&gt;&gt; LOOK AT THIS, SMASHED --
&gt;&gt; VALERIA'S NEIGHBORS, LIKE

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:42.929
HER, COOKING OUTSIDE.
SHE HAS BROUGHT ME TO WHAT IS

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:44.430
LEFT OF OUR FRIENDS.
&gt;&gt; IT'S ALL DESTROYED.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:51.137
PEOPLE HERE, THEY SURVIVE?
&gt;&gt; GOD SAVE THEM, SHE SAYS, BUT

00:02:51.137 --> 00:02:53.906
NOT A LEFT.
&gt;&gt; BY LOCAL STANDARDS, THE

00:02:53.906 --> 00:02:59.078
SHELLING THIS DAY LESS THAN
USUAL.

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:03.182
THIS ELDERLY LADY VENTURING OUT
FOR FOOD.

00:03:03.182 --> 00:03:08.054
SHE TELLS US THE FOOD AND SHE
NEEDS HAS NOT ARRIVED.

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:12.125
THE SHELLING GETTING CLOSER WE
GO.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:19.098
NOT SO LUCKY, THOSE WHO BEHIND.
NIC ROBERTSON, CNN, SIVERSK, UKRAINE

